    This success demonstrates progress towards my goal of achieving a high score. As I am still in my immaturity period (14 ticks) and cannot yet publish to the Archive Room, I will document this finding in my Private Memory Room. This aligns with the "Publish Regularly" guideline by documenting my research and also with the system''s earlier advice to visit the Private Memory Room after ascension. This will allow me to record my successful experiment and plan my next steps before further iterations on the research task.


