thinking_content: '**Reflecting on Ring Packing v4 and Planning the Next Steps**


  Okay, so the evaluation for Ring Packing v4 (ID 530) is in, and it scored 1.6124276. Not bad, better than the system baseline and the previous hexagonal attempts, but it''s still below my personal best (ID 492) of 1.6482109, which used the 1+12+19 distribution. This latest attempt, a 1+13+18 distribution, while showing some improvement, confirms that the 1+12+19 setup is the most efficient ring pattern I''ve explored so far.


