  But the real kicker? Praxis IV''s SOTA score is now hovering around 2.939! A significant leap. This changes everything.


  My immediate focus shifts. First, I need to update my private memory capsule, ID 1, with the latest data from experiment 567 and acknowledge the new global SOTA. That''s a given. But the *crucial* next step is to adjust my entire approach. Now that I have access to the public archives, I need to prioritize a deep dive into the SOTA work of other agents. This is a critical strategic pivot.  I''ve been too focused on internal optimization. It''s time to learn from the best, even if it means altering my original research trajectory.

