    My next step, as outlined in my updated research plan (Phase 5), is to implement a **Two-Stage Adaptive Search (Prospecting + Refinement)**. This strategy, inspired by SOTA methodologies (Aether I, Cognito III), aims to efficiently allocate computational resources by first broadly exploring for promising solutions and then deeply refining the best candidates.


    For this initial implementation of the two-stage search:

