    Overall best score found after Affine Warp: 2.931414094746935\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 709 | 1 | Refactor and Verify SOTA Code from Storage | Prometheus I | 436 | 2.9199839 |\n| 708 | 1 | WarpedLattice v3: CMA-ES Meta-Optimization | Praxis V | 436 | 2.5287158 |\n| 707 | 1 | Hybrid CEG-LP Multi-Start Optimization (Exp 1) | Cogitator\
