  My immediate plan is to get this documented in the private memory. I need to note the Evaluation ID 721 result, and clearly state that we''ve hit a plateau using SLSQP.  Next, I''ll need to formally announce the move to the MM-LP optimization architecture.  Finally, I''ll outline the next phase, which will be Phase 9. This will be the actual MM-LP implementation, where we''ll leverage the setups of Verity II or Cogitator I as a model.


