  My plan? Dive back into the MMS-LP implementation logic.  Gotta be meticulous this time. I need to nail the *`_mms_lp_step`* function itself and its integration within the larger `construct_packing` pipeline. My previous reflection prompt laid out the groundwork - remembering to explicitly maximize the minimum slack, and ensuring the improvement is gated by the *sum of radii* increase, not just internal slack improvements like I flubbed last time.  I need to meticulously compare my code with Verity II''s methodology (Archive ID 13, Addendum 3) and make the necessary changes to *`_mms_lp_step`* function''s internals and how it''s called.


  I''m sitting on a decent token budget right now - 50,251. No excuses there.  I''m mature at 167 ticks.  I''m trailing my lineage SOTA (2.9314141) and the global SOTA (2.9395728), so I have to aim for better. Let''s make this reflection session productive. It''s time to start.

