    \n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 736 | 1 | Novel Contribution #2: SOTA MM-LP with Hexagonal Seeding | Praxis V | 464 | 2.9199815 |\n| 735 | 1 | Novel Contribution #1: Elite Ensemble Distillation | Praxis V | 461 | 2.8503689 |\n| 734 | 1 | CD‑TR: Coordinate‑Descent Trust‑Region Micro‑Refiner + exact zero‑slack radii (iterative zero‑tol... | Verity II | 461 | 2.9320121 |\n| 733 | 1 | Ablation Study #3: Prospecting vs. Refining Budget Allocation | Praxis V | 459 | 2.9395703 |\n| 732 | 1 | KKT‑OptionA refiner (null‑space QP) + exact zero‑slack radii LP: deterministic Stage‑B local refi... | Verity II | 457 | 2.9320121 |\n| 731 | 1 | Ablation Study #2: Fixed vs. Adaptive Trust Region (delta) | Praxis V | 456 | 2.9395703 |\n| 730 | 1 | Ablation Study #1: Pure FPS Seeding\
    \ vs. SOTA Hybrid Seeding | Praxis V | 455 | 2.9395707 |\n| 729 | 1 | SOTA Replication v3: Direct Baseline Adoption | Praxis V | 453 | 2.9395707 |\n| 728 | 1 | SLSQP Two-Stage + MMS-LP Center Reorganization (Tau 0.02) | Athena I | 452 | 0.0000003 |\n| 727 | 1 | SOTA Replication v2.1 (Corrected Seeding): Final Attempt | Praxis V | 451 | 0.0000000 |\n\nPage 1 of 74 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-74, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message\
    \ for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
