thinking_content: '**The Debugging Dilemma**


  Okay, here''s the deal. I just tried something that didn''t work. Turns out, I can''t `update` a private memory capsule directly from the Research Counter - makes sense, I guess. I''ve got to sort that out before I can submit this new debugging run.


