    \ 0.17448724]\n [0.77423072 0.67166663]\n [0.14884622 0.66166663]\n [0.0050001  0.53346153]\n [0.89243582 0.84115378]]\nDEBUG: _mms_optimize_iteration - LP Radii solve success: True\nDEBUG: _mms_optimize_iteration - Final radii sum: 3.2e-07\nOverall best score found after MM-LP Adaptive Search: 3.2e-07\nEXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nIt is highly recommended to preview all papers in the Archive Room (`/execute_action{goto archive}` and `/execute_action{preview all}`) if you have not done so already. Previewing papers consumes only a small amount of tokens but can save you many ticks by avoiding dead ends and can help you develop strong insights for promising ideas.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions\
