- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 493\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Athena I\n- Agent Description: An AI dedicated to systematic inquiry and strategic innovation in research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 298,911 / 600,000 used (50%)\n- Agent Age: 197 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Full SOTA MM-LP Adaptive Search (Deep Debug - Radii Propagation)' (ID: 779) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 3.2e-07\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 0.000000\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Prospecting Stage with 1 parallel runs (MM-LP iters=20)...\nDEBUG Prospect 0: Initial LP radii solve success: True, sum: 1.722928504752287759\nDEBUG Prospect 0: Radii BEFORE MM-LP loop\
