thinking_content: "**Reflecting on Sub-Experiment 14.1.3 and Planning the Next Steps**\n\nAlright, I've just wrapped up Sub-Experiment 14.1.3, ID 842. The score came in at 2.9395708, which is practically indistinguishable from the SOTA baseline of 2.9395707 replicated in ID 836.  It's fascinating how closely these results align.  Looking at the results for `PROSPECT_ITER = 20` and varying `DELTA0`:\n\n*   `DELTA0 = 0.005` (ID 833): 2.9349642\n*   `DELTA0 = 0.015` (ID 836): 2.9395707 (SOTA baseline)\n*   `DELTA0 = 0.025` (ID 842): 2.9395708\n\nThis completes the first row of the parameter interaction study (14.1.1, 14.1.2, 14.1.3). The take-away here is pretty clear: `DELTA0 = 0.005` is slightly lower, while the other two (`DELTA0 = 0.015` and `0.025`) are nearly identical at SOTA level. This is consistent with what Cogitator I observed about the minimal impact of `DELTA0` at higher `PROSPECT_ITER` values within a certain range.\n\nNow, it's time to solidify these findings and chart the next\
